// Base build configuration for the Spend app target (Debug and Release).
//
// PostHog analytics: the project key and host. Both are read into the app's
// Info.plist (POSTHOG_API_KEY, POSTHOG_HOST) and from there by
// Spend/Services/Analytics.swift. With an empty key the app runs with
// analytics off and logs "analytics off: no key" once.
//
// Sentry crash reports: the DSN, read the same way (SENTRY_DSN) by
// Spend/Services/CrashReporting.swift. Empty means crash reports are off.
//
// Never put the real key or DSN here: copy Secrets.xcconfig.example to
// Secrets.xcconfig (gitignored) and fill it in. It is included below when it
// exists and its values win over these defaults.
// In an xcconfig "//" starts a comment, so the host is written with an
// empty $() in the middle; it reads back as https://eu.i.posthog.com.
POSTHOG_API_KEY =
POSTHOG_HOST = https:/$()/eu.i.posthog.com
SENTRY_DSN =

#include? "Secrets.xcconfig"
